{"code":"geocoach-austria-region-metas","tips":[{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78246","section":"Burgenland","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=4ID_g-WwjSGOSxU8oMG8NQ&viewpoint=47.809598181564176%2C16.950212808315833&heading=28.414530172244476&pitch=-7.480690785983882","text":"Green “Güterweg” signs are found in Burgenland.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78246"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78247","section":"Lower Austria","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=NNEvPdt3cr5X9SGflTHkOA&viewpoint=48.863609533446116%2C15.505211709062282&heading=16.25&pitch=-5.680000000000007","text":"In Lower Austria, you may find signs with yellow and blue sign borders, corresponding to the flag of the region.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78247"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78249","section":"Upper Austria","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=X9TGJaO1W4P6fgns-GUYyA&viewpoint=48.525598942545244%2C13.875319297415441&heading=259.57&pitch=-8.950000000000003","text":"White “Güterweg” signs with a black outline are mainly found in Upper Austria.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78249"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78248","section":"Salzburg","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=s8FhBfvfKFJ4YBSoNPhcJg&viewpoint=47.298878298584135%2C12.991329559992648&heading=74.01&pitch=-22.629999999999995","text":"A large white painted square in the middle of the road can be found next to kilometre markers in Salzburg.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78248"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78255","section":"meta pole vienna (wien)","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=d6xlMTWB1ed1DS99Lm4a8w&viewpoint=48.20823743723003%2C16.332614080354816&heading=257.53&pitch=-13.459999999999994","text":"The Viennese ribbons are thinner, and there are usually two of them on each flagpole. (This can also be seen in neighboring cities)","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78255"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78256","section":"meta pole innsbruck","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=i4kGZb4Cg3CtH2DuzsvzBQ&viewpoint=47.2734200699642%2C11.405047000286903&heading=234.87&pitch=-11.099999999999994","text":"They can be differentiated by the fact that the tapes in Vienna are thinner, and there are typically two on each pole. (This can also be seen in neighboring cities)","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78256"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78251","section":"Vorarlberg and road in western Salzburg","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=4BNd1Kh3NPXUDkcY02lvQA&viewpoint=47.371437710071454%2C12.694863171384029&heading=329.9&pitch=-5.920000000000002","text":"White kilometre markers can be found in Vorarlberg as well as on a road in western Salzburg.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78251"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78252","section":"Bus stops Vorarlberg","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=wtmCx_yvp86fsORvH0TeiA&viewpoint=47.52918477457258%2C9.751615243434545&heading=36.7&pitch=-12.079999999999998","text":"Bus stops consisting of neon-yellow poles are found in Vorarlberg.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78252"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78253","section":"yellow and white stripes Vorarlberg","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=g5leVArRmQN-CXLO9RW4-w&viewpoint=47.23487322949745%2C9.590279140607887&heading=272.97&pitch=-5.230000000000004","text":"These yellow and white stripes around poles and signposts are found in Vorarlberg.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"78253"},{"id":"geocoach-austria-region-metas-78257","section":"lake","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=tYFK6ufEbi-GajpeLPQl1w&viewpoint=47.51361627611176%2C9.753804486908571&heading=258.95&pitch=-3.480000000000004","text":"Lake Constance (known in German as the Bodensee) is a large lake 